    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Resolve + promote",
      "items": [
        "work resolves the reference by path (the id)",
        "If no folder exists (Abstract), work auto-inits one -- promotion",
        "init always yields a valid task; it cannot produce an Invalid one"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The gate is mandatory",
      "items": [
        "validate classifies via task.yaml: Active / Invalid / Remote",
        "Both errors AND warnings block work -- fix forward, no recovery",
        "A Remote task (tmp + host mismatch) cannot be worked locally"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Activate + dispatch",
      "items": [
        "Only after passing does work set the single global current pointer",
        "work loads the task's skills_to_invoke and dispatches to agent_hint",
        "The self-documenting task carries its own context to the sub-agent"
